    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d715">

                <pb facs="0940" n="844" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg844"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bridgman to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                                Paz, Bolivia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-05-19"><hi rendition="#italic">May 19,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 28.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to announce that after
                    considerable delay the note came from the minister of foreign relations at Sucre
                    containing the assurance of the neutrality of Bolivia in relation to the
                    existing war between the United States and Spain.</p>
                <p>I inclose herewith a copy of the original note and a translation of the same. The
                    announcement arrived at the legation late on May 16 and I cabled the fact to
                    Washington on the morning of May 17, as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Neutrality assurance just received from Bolivian Government.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. H. Bridgman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d715-a1.xml" xpointer="d715-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
